So in this question we have to find the smallest multiple of k that is missing from the vector.
What we do is make a set take values of the vector and then iterate over it 
start by searching from first multiple of k if it is not present return the multiple else keep moving.

code ---
class Solution {
public:
    int missingMultiple(vector<int>& nums, int k) {
        unordered_set<int> st(nums.begin(), nums.end());

        for (int i = 1; ; i++) {
            int multiple = k * i;

            if (!st.count(multiple))
                return multiple;
        }
    }
};
time complexity = O(n)
